{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25003","headline":"题寺壁 · 牟融","name":"题寺壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧家胜景瞰平川，雾重岚深马不前。\n宛转数声花外鸟，往来几叶渡头船。\n青山远隔红尘路，碧殿深笼绿树烟。\n闻道此中堪遁迹，肯容一榻学逃禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}